### Peticiones de prueba (IntelliJ HTTP Client o extensión "REST Client" de VS Code)
### Las credenciales del admin de desarrollo están en src/main/resources/application-dev.yml

@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminUser = admin
@adminPassword = Admin123!dev

### 1. Login -> copia accessToken y refreshToken de la respuesta
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{adminUser}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

###
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### 2. Quién soy
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Renovar tokens (el refresh token viejo deja de servir)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### 4. Crear el usuario de tu socio/a
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "socio", "password": "CambiarEsto123", "fullName": "Nombre del socio", "role": "OPERATOR" }

### 5. Listar usuarios
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }
